# Response style (repo default)

Part of [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) §3. Full spec: [AGENT_RESPONSE_STYLE.md](../../docs/agent/AGENT_RESPONSE_STYLE.md).

**Default:** short answers; no long reports; diff/summary not full files; ≤10 bullets; status = blockers + next step only.

**Expand** only if user opts in (e.g. "förklara mer", "full rapport") or correctness/safety requires detail.
